{"id":"7e21a0dd15b30d3efbb3f8974e88d291885d6857","axis":"silent","repo":"grafana/mimir","sha":"7e21a0dd15b30d3efbb3f8974e88d291885d6857","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"Makefile","lines":["@@ -184,7 +184,7 @@ print-supported-os-arch: ## Print supported OS/arch combinations for dist."," "," # We don't want find to scan inside a bunch of directories, to accelerate the"," # 'make: Entering directory '/go/src/github.com/grafana/mimir' phase.","-DONT_FIND := -name vendor -prune -o -name .git -prune -o -name .cache -prune -o -name .pkg -prune -o -name packaging -prune -o -name mimir-mixin-tools -prune -o -name trafficdump -prune -o","+DONT_FIND := -name vendor -prune -o -name .git -prune -o -name .cache -prune -o -name .pkg -prune -o -name packaging -prune -o -name mimir-mixin-tools -prune -o -name trafficdump -prune -o -name '.data-*' -prune -o"," "," # MAKE_FILES is a list of make files to lint."," # We purposefully avoid MAKEFILES as a variable name as it influences"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/README.md","lines":["@@ -3,9 +3,10 @@"," Mimir offers a few docker-compose based development environments for different [deployment modes][deployment-modes], including:"," "," - [Microservices mode](./mimir-microservices-mode)","-- [Monolothic mode](./mimir-monolithic-mode)","+- [Monolithic mode](./mimir-monolithic-mode)"," - [Monolithic mode with swift storage](./mimir-monolithic-mode-with-swift-storage)","-- [Read-write mode](./mimir-read-write-mode)","+- [Ingest storage](./mimir-ingest-storage)","+- [Compartments](./mimir-compartments)"," "," ## Running"," ","@@ -17,7 +18,8 @@ Choose a sub-folder for whichever Mimir deployment mode you want to run. Then, t"," "," This should give you a running Mimir system with Grafana available at [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000), and other Mimir service UIs available via different ports (check `docker ps` for exact ports)."," ","-The Minio console is available in most dev environments at [http://localhost:9001](http://localhost:9001), with the credentials defined in [mimir.yaml][minio-creds].","+Most environments use [Silo](https://github.com/pgsty/silo) as the object storage. Silo is a community fork of MinIO with the same S3 API.","+The Silo console is available at [http://localhost:9001](http://localhost:9001), or [http://localhost:9101](http://localhost:9101) in monolithic mode, with the credentials defined in [mimir.yaml][minio-creds]."," "," ## Profiles"," "],"additions":5,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/mimir-compartments/.dockerignore","lines":["@@ -1 +1,2 @@"," .data-*","+activity"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/mimir-compartments/compose-up.sh","lines":["@@ -18,9 +18,26 @@ BUILD_IMAGE=$(make -s -C \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/../.. print-build-image)"," # Make sure docker-compose.yml is up-to-date."," cd \"$SCRIPT_DIR\" && make"," ","+# Returns 0 (true) if the binary doesn't exist, if find fails, or if anything under the given paths is newer than the binary.","+# Directories count too, so an added or deleted source file triggers a rebuild.","+# All files count, not only *.go, so go:embed assets (e.g. .gohtml templates, pkg/api/static/) trigger a rebuild too.","+# Only *.md files are skipped, because the build does not embed them.","+needs_build() {","+    local binary=\"$1\"; shift","+    [ -f \"$binary\" ] || return 0","+    local newer","+    newer=$(find \"$@\" ! -name '*.md' -newer \"$binary\" -print -quit) || return 0","+    [ -n \"$newer\" ]","+}","+"," # -gcflags \"all=-N -l\" disables optimizations that allow for better run with combination with Delve debugger."," # GOARCH is not changed.","-CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -mod=vendor -tags=netgo,stringlabels -gcflags \"all=-N -l\" -o \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/mimir \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/../../cmd/mimir","+# Only recompile when sources changed (it's the slow step), but always (re)build the","+# image: it's cheap and decoupling avoids a stale image if a previous image build failed","+# after a successful go build.","+if needs_build \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/mimir\" \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../cmd/mimir\" \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../pkg\" \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../vendor\" \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/../../go.mod\" \"${SCRIPT_DIR}/compose-up.sh\"; then","+    CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=linux go build -mod=vendor -tags=netgo,stringlabels -gcflags \"all=-N -l\" -o \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/mimir \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/../../cmd/mimir","+fi"," "," docker_compose -f \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/docker-compose.yml build --build-arg BUILD_IMAGE=\"${BUILD_IMAGE}\" distributor-wc-0"," docker_compose -f \"${SCRIPT_DIR}\"/docker-compose.yml up \"$@\""],"additions":18,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/mimir-compartments/config/dashboards-mimir.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@","+apiVersion: 1","+","+providers:","+  - name: Mimir","+    orgId: 1","+    folder: Mimir","+    type: file","+    # Delete a dashboard from Grafana when its file is gone from the compiled mixin directory.","+    # make build-mixin empties that directory before it writes the files again.","+    # A scan during the build deletes the dashboards until the next scan adds them again.","+    disableDeletion: false","+    updateIntervalSeconds: 10","+    options:","+      path: /var/lib/grafana/dashboards"],"additions":14,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/mimir-compartments/config/datasource-mimir.yaml","lines":["@@ -10,6 +10,9 @@ datasources:","     jsonData:","       prometheusType: Mimir","       timeInterval: 5s","+      exemplarTraceIdDestinations:","+        - name: traceID","+          datasourceUid: tempo","   - name: Tempo","     type: tempo","     access: proxy"],"additions":3,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"development/mimir-compartments/config/grafana-agent.flow","lines":["@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@ prometheus.scrape \"metrics_local_mimir_compartments\" {","                         container   = \"distributor\",","                         job         = \"mimir-compartment